# CI/CD Workflow & Deployment Policy

**DO NOT execute manual deployments** on every incremental change.

## Release Process
1. Changes must go through a branch / Pull Request and merge to `main`.
2. Automated GitHub Actions CI/CD executes:
   - Typecheck & Unit tests
   - Automated deployment on merge to `main`
   - Post-deployment smoke tests & health checks
